{"overview":"Jimmy, the owner of a failed music shop, goes to work with his uncle, the owner of a food factory. Before he gets there, he befriends an Irish family who happens to be his uncle's worst enemy because of their love for music and in-house band who constantly practices. Soon, Jimmy finds himself trying to help the band by getting them gigs and trying to reconcile the family with his uncle.","tagline":"It's the prize romantic laugh of the year... more fun than winning the POT O' GOLD!","cast":[{"n":"James Stewart","c":"James Hamilton 'Jimmy' Haskell","p":"/3CU3yG3rCTlG3SwxI9iUOzfHtfX.jpg","q":"Q102462"},{"n":"Paulette Goddard","c":"Molly McCorkle","p":"/7fMtXuVbJMbsFB4U3CsgDdivizP.jpg","q":"Q95050"},{"n":"Horace Heidt","c":"Horace Heidt","p":"/x4V1tqmCJk5h39aqkjQbbZKjglc.jpg","q":"Q744222"},{"n":"Charles Winninger","c":"Charles 'C.J.' Haskell","p":"/ga4o02ASamp2g2vDZfdl2Uxddqk.jpg","q":"Q2080114"},{"n":"Mary Gordon","c":"Mom McCorkle","p":"/5jhUhQa0ArqB8p5cr8EwIXNeihx.jpg","q":"Q467968"},{"n":"Frank Melton","c":"Jasper Backus","p":"/6GYY81QNx9EJ0AbI5uhVDKVznXt.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Jed Prouty","c":"J.K. Louderman","p":"/cRB15sXHs5HETFBn7WWK6dSyhXa.jpg","q":"Q6172615"},{"n":"Charles Arnt","c":"Parks (butler)","p":"/flc0PTLf4I7i21l8NeG8Td49fxC.jpg","q":"Q2958418"},{"n":"James Flavin","c":"Sheriff Bud Connolly","p":"/zF6D2GWaLx2TyRm4qDTqwCk6JWg.jpg","q":"Q1308174"},{"n":"Dick Hogan","c":"Willie McCorkle","p":"/flVJUew1pntgd4PQeMOgnh6V92i.jpg","q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pot_o%27_Gold_(film)","qid":"Q1129189","rel":{"US":{"d":"1941-04-03","c":"NR"}}}